      "title": "Stream a generated 64 MiB file in 64 KiB chunks",
      "package": "fileio",
      "chart_label": "64 MiB file streaming",
      "unit": "passes",
      "default_work": 4,
      "equivalence": "Build setup creates build/storage_fixture.bin as exactly 64 MiB of the repeated byte sequence 0..255. Each timed pass opens it and reads to EOF in requested 65536-byte chunks. A low-overhead deterministic checksum adds each chunk's length, first byte, and last byte so validation does not dominate I/O. Print exactly: bytes=67108864 reps=R checksum=C. File generation is build-time setup and excluded from run timing.",
      "implementations": [
        {
          "id": "storage-stream-koka",
          "language": "Koka",
          "version_command": ["../../../../../kk", "--version"],
